! TREXC.DBG - SET BREAK/EXCEPTION and SS$_TBIT (part A): what the
! break shows, where the program is, and whether GO and STEP pass the
! condition on to the program's handler.
SET BREAK/EXCEPTION
SHOW BREAK
GO
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
EVALUATE %EXC_NAME
SHOW CALLS
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
GO
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
SHOW CALLS
EXAMINE TCOUNT
CANCEL BREAK/ALL
GO
